  "about-reads": {"title":"Hearthwoven","owner":"Rowan","listTitle":"About","scope":"","heading":"What it reads","headingWindow":"","headingSource":"","headingSrc":"","showAbout":1,"shareNote":"","active":"Deeds","page":"reads","hasFilters":0,"everyoneChip":1,"everyoneOn":0,"everyoneSub":"on Deeds and more","everyoneWhy":"The group view is on Deeds, Hall, Battle and Voyages. Press to open Deeds > Cooking for the whole group.","everyoneTo":"Deeds/cooking","chapters":[{"id":"Deeds","label":"Deeds","icon":"ui:chapter-deeds","selected":0,"dot":0,"disabled":0},{"id":"Feats","label":"Feats","icon":"vocab:list-feats","selected":0,"dot":0,"disabled":0},{"id":"Company","label":"Company","icon":"ui:chapter-company","selected":0,"dot":0,"disabled":0},{"id":"Stores","label":"Hall","icon":"ui:chapter-stores","selected":0,"dot":0,"disabled":0},{"id":"Battle","label":"Battle","icon":"ui:chapter-battle","selected":0,"dot":0,"disabled":0},{"id":"Voyages","label":"Voyages","icon":"ui:chapter-voyages","selected":0,"dot":0,"disabled":0},{"id":"Skills","label":"Skills","icon":"ui:chapter-skills","selected":0,"dot":0,"disabled":0}],"list":[{"id":"counts","label":"How it counts","icon":"","selected":0,"dot":0,"disabled":0},{"id":"reads","label":"What it reads","icon":"","selected":1,"dot":0,"disabled":0},{"id":"sharing","label":"Sharing","icon":"","selected":0,"dot":0,"disabled":0}],"badges":[],"toggle":[],"windows":[],"biomes":[],"players":[{"id":"","label":"Rowan","icon":"person:Rowan","selected":1,"dot":0,"disabled":0},{"id":"Edda","label":"Edda","icon":"person:Edda","selected":0,"dot":0,"disabled":0},{"id":"Finch","label":"Finch","icon":"person:Finch","selected":0,"dot":0,"disabled":0},{"id":"Tor","label":"Tor","icon":"person:Tor","selected":0,"dot":0,"disabled":0}],"keys":[{"text":"[Q/E·A/D] Chapter"},{"text":"[W/S] Page"},{"text":"[T/Esc] Back"},{"text":"[H/Tab] Close"}],"personColors":{"Rowan":1,"Edda":2,"Finch":3,"Tor":4},"palette":[{"c":"#d6ccb3"},{"c":"#9b4a50"},{"c":"#5f86a0"},{"c":"#94a56c"},{"c":"#c4923f"},{"c":"#8f7599"},{"c":"#4d7a69"},{"c":"#80807c"}],"blocks":[{"kind":"plate","id":"","icon":"vocab:about-info","title":"What it reads","value":"","text":"","note":"","tone":"","source":"","fraction":0,"selected":0,"src":"","colour":"","pattern":"","fraction2":0,"value2":"","count":0,"level":0,"progress":-1,"practised":0,"pill":"","pillIcon":"","columns":0,"keyCap":"","open":0,"items":[{"kind":"readrows","id":"","icon":"","title":"","value":"","text":"","note":"","tone":"","source":"","fraction":0,"selected":0,"src":"","colour":"","pattern":"","fraction2":0,"value2":"","count":0,"level":0,"progress":-1,"practised":0,"pill":"","pillIcon":"","columns":0,"keyCap":"","open":0,"items":[{"kind":"readrow","id":"","icon":"vocab:src-stone","title":"Your character's own count","value":"","text":"The game's counters, kept with your character in every world, also from before Hearthwoven: trees felled, pieces built, crafts, foes defeated. They can miss some work: what you do where a fellow player's PC hosts the area, and items you pick up onto a stack you already carry.","note":"","tone":"","source":"","fraction":0,"selected":0,"src":"","colour":"","pattern":"","fraction2":0,"value2":"","count":0,"level":0,"progress":-1,"practised":0,"pill":"","pillIcon":"","columns":0,"keyCap":"","open":0,"items":[]},{"kind":"readrow","id":"","icon":"vocab:src-hearth","title":"Hearthwoven on this PC","value":"","text":"Counts from the day you installed it: damage, blocks and parries, repairs, smelting, carts, whose food you enjoyed, and exactly what you brought in. Only these start at install. Battle's windows look back from now. Some counts began in a later version: their page says from when.","note":"","tone":"","source":"","fraction":0,"selected":0,"src":"","colour":"","pattern":"","fraction2":0,"value2":"","count":0,"level":0,"progress":-1,"practised":0,"pill":"","pillIcon":"","columns":0,"keyCap":"","open":0,"items":[]},{"kind":"readrow","id":"","icon":"vocab:list-feats","title":"Feats","value":"","text":"A moment worth telling, earned by doing it: a rule, a number and a date, never a rank. Unsung ones are not earned yet. A title is earned by its own count; there is no combined score.","note":"","tone":"","source":"","fraction":0,"selected":0,"src":"","colour":"","pattern":"","fraction2":0,"value2":"","count":0,"level":0,"progress":-1,"practised":0,"pill":"","pillIcon":"","columns":0,"keyCap":"","open":0,"items":[]},{"kind":"readrow","id":"","icon":"vocab:block-mark","title":"Your armor","value":"","text":"Battle > Defense, What your armor stopped: each hit as it reached your armor and as it left it, on this PC from the day this version first ran. Falls, drowning and cold never meet armor; What hurt you counts them too.","note":"","tone":"","source":"","fraction":0,"selected":0,"src":"","colour":"","pattern":"","fraction2":0,"value2":"","count":0,"level":0,"progress":-1,"practised":0,"pill":"","pillIcon":"","columns":0,"keyCap":"","open":0,"items":[]}]}],"islands":[{"span":"wide","parts":[{"path":"0"}]}]}]},
